  <ThingDef ParentName="AnimalThingBase" ADogSaidBody="LegsTail">
    <defName>RSW_Akk</defName>
    <label>akk</label>
    <description>Akk (or sometimes called 'akk hounds'), were large reptomammals native to the planet Haruun Kal. Great companions, Akk matured from pups to hounds in a relatively short time and were often used for protection due to their likelihood to form strong bonds with their master. The illegal smuggling of these loyal but dangerous creatures has lead to them being found on many worlds.</description>
